{"title":"Weekly Monday 10AM Morning Badminton Meetup","startsAt":"2026-10-05T10:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-05T12:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Event Cost :** **$10** per person, ( including one piece of brand new standard feather birdie.)\n**Racquets :** Bring your own racquet. Rentals are available at the club if needed.\n**Shoes :** Please bring indoor gym shoes and change into them at the club before entering the courts.\n**This is a casual meetup group for people in the Markham or Scarborough to play 2 hours morning badminton to pursue your ultimate healthy life! Free sign up and all skill levels are welcome!!**","venue":{"name":"Tiger badminton","address":"7755 warden ave, Unit 7, Markham","lat":43.83723,"lng":-79.32842,"city":"Markham"},"fee":null,"group":"GTA Weekday Badminton","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/0/1/2/highres_534376402.jpeg"}